        "DebugDisplay": "Dynamic new cutscenes and crowd, weather and lighting updates capture the atmosphere, while a new time-of-day system can see changing conditions during the match. From the touchline, your influence is greater than ever, with all-new Tactical Tweaks, reworked Shouts and a deeper Data Hub. New skills, an overhauled running system, refined movements, and more control over how your players attack the box make it more rewarding to watch the action. ",
